<html><head>
<title>icondoc - Icon Documentation</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="./style.css">
<head><body>
<div class="content main"><h1>icondoc</h1>
<p>
IconDoc is a documentation tool, converting Icon file comments into html 
or vimhelp documentation: it is inspired by Ruby's rdoc.
</p><p>
MIT Licence
</p><p>
Copyright (c) 2019-24, Peter Lane
</p><p>
